I left a couple of rough edges in that file (an empty `prefix` span on the search input, a pointless re-export of `formatDate`, and an awkward visually-hidden header). Let me check the Input and Select docs before rewriting it cleanly.

Two things to be careful about: `Select` extends `Input` (so `error`/`errorMessage` are valid), and Input's props don't declare `aria-*`, so I'll drop those attributes (the `error` prop already handles invalid state). I'll also use `Text` with an `as` prop for the visually hidden header via `VisuallyHidden`. Here is the cleaned-up component.

